<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111928" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοῖβος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span> (accented <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιβάν</span> in <i><span class="en">
			B.
			12.139
		</span></i> Pap.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pure,
				bright, radiant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					274
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				1009
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡλίου φοίβῃ φλογί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					22
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴγλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
				</span></i>
			 l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as pr.
			n., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φοῖβος, ὁ,</span>
			<i>Phoebus,</i> i.e. <i>the Bright</i> or <i>Pure,</i> an old
			epith. of Apollo, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φ. Ἀπόλλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.43
				</span></i>
			, al.; rarely inverted, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀπόλλων φοῖβος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					20.68
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				194
			</span></i>: then alone as pr. n., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.443
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				61
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prophet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				55.85
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Panamara</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
